* Canonical Day 4 OTA subcircuit.
* DAY4_MANIFEST_SHA256=@@MANIFEST_SHA256@@
* Pin order: VDD VSS VINP VINN VOUT VBP(IREF input node)
.subckt SKY130_TWO_STAGE_OTA VDD VSS VINP VINN VOUT VBP

* Single-IREF bias tree.  Every bulk and return has an explicit rail.
XM8  VBP  VBP VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 L=@@L8@@ W=@@W8@@ nf=1 mult=1
XM9  VBN  VBP VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 L=@@L9@@ W=@@W9@@ nf=1 mult=1
XM10 VBN  VBN VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 L=@@L10@@ W=@@W10@@ nf=1 mult=1

* Differential first stage; M3/M4 are each two explicit parallel units.
XM1  NMIR VINN TAIL VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 L=@@L1@@ W=@@W1@@ nf=1 mult=1
XM2  VX   VINP TAIL VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 L=@@L2@@ W=@@W2@@ nf=1 mult=1
XM3A NMIR NMIR VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 L=@@L3@@ W=@@W3UNIT@@ nf=1 mult=1
XM3B NMIR NMIR VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 L=@@L3@@ W=@@W3UNIT@@ nf=1 mult=1
XM4A VX   NMIR VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 L=@@L4@@ W=@@W4UNIT@@ nf=1 mult=1
XM4B VX   NMIR VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 L=@@L4@@ W=@@W4UNIT@@ nf=1 mult=1
XM5  TAIL VBN  VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 L=@@L5@@ W=@@W5@@ nf=1 mult=1

* Common-source second stage and Miller compensation.
XM6 VOUT VX  VSS VSS sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 L=@@L6@@ W=@@W6@@ nf=1 mult=1
XM7 VOUT VBP VDD VDD sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 L=@@L7@@ W=@@W7@@ nf=1 mult=1
RZ1 VX NCC @@RZ_OHM@@
CC1 NCC VOUT @@CC_F@@

.ends SKY130_TWO_STAGE_OTA
